- **CVE-2022-2588** (Dirty Pipe in containers) allowed escape from **Kubernetes pods**:
  ```bash
  kubectl exec -it pod-name -- /bin/sh
  ./dirty_pipe_container
  ```
- Attackers exploited this to **mount host filesystem** and modify `/etc/shadow`.

